程序 GC模式: 4.

>> Doubler := 对象 新建.
>> Multiplier := 对象 新建.
Doubler 在: ['double:and:'] 执行: { :x :y
	>> q := x + 1. <- ((x × 2) + (y × 2)).
}.

Multiplier 在: ['multiply:and:'] 执行: { :x :y <- (x × y).
}.

输出 写入: (
	Doubler double:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
	and:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
), 停止.
